# SSH connection format

Always connect to the remote host using this exact format:

`ssh -i ~/.ssh/7-5-25kuroit joshfialkoff@[ip address associated with workspace]`

For this workspace, use:

`ssh -i ~/.ssh/7-5-25kuroit joshfialkoff@104.168.38.162`
